1
00:00:13,860 --> 00:00:18,160
How many times do I have to tell you?
We can't look after a dog.

2
00:00:19,320 --> 00:00:22,500
Don't be like that.
Just take one look at him.

3
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:26,320
I won't fall for that. You think I'll
say he's cute once I've seen him?

4
00:00:29,850 --> 00:00:32,285
Come on, please?

5
00:00:32,970 --> 00:00:39,970
Go on! Hey, don't stop all of a sudden!
What was that? Jeez!

6
00:00:46,580 --> 00:00:50,000
Kakeru, a dog that big is
obviously out of the question.

7
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:53,580
Whoa, a monster!
There's a monster!

8
00:00:57,720 --> 00:01:00,360
Take it back where you found it, right now.

9
00:01:01,090 --> 00:01:03,180
I don't know anything
about a dog that big!

10
00:01:04,130 --> 00:01:07,600
What are you talking about?
You brought it here!

11
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:11,030
How could I bring
something that big?

12
00:01:11,950 --> 00:01:15,400
Well, well, long time no see, kids.
It's me, Specter.

13
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:18,950
How does it feel to be
shrunk by the Nano Cannon?

14
00:01:22,330 --> 00:01:23,830
The Nano Cannon?

15
00:01:24,630 --> 00:01:27,910
Don't tell me we've been shrunk?
Wait a minute!

16
00:01:29,330 --> 00:01:30,940
Change us back!

17
00:01:31,510 --> 00:01:37,050
Hmph. You still don't understand
the position you're in.

18
00:01:37,850 --> 00:01:41,880
Shrunk as you are,
there's nothing you can do.

19
00:01:43,550 --> 00:01:46,900
Cut it out!
We have friends, you know.

20
00:01:46,900 --> 00:01:50,230
They'll beat you in no time!

21
00:01:52,710 --> 00:01:55,710
Hello? Natsumi?

22
00:01:56,310 --> 00:01:59,310
Ooh, so this is a real video phone!

23
00:02:01,260 --> 00:02:06,840
Could these be the ones
you're calling for help?

24
00:02:10,280 --> 00:02:17,280
I'll study humans using them as test subjects,
and rule humanity through fear!

25
00:02:18,550 --> 00:02:25,300
Enjoy yourselves with
the minions I've sent you.

26
00:02:26,025 --> 00:02:27,525
Bye-bye.

27
00:02:36,500 --> 00:02:43,500
- What?! We're going to be crushed!
- This is what I was saving it for...

28
00:02:49,540 --> 00:02:56,540
What do we do now?

29
00:02:59,720 --> 00:03:03,760
Don't worry.
I've still got an ace up my sleeve.

